<title>UK: LONRHO EXPECTS HOTELS DECISION BY END-SEPT.</title>
<headline>LONRHO EXPECTS HOTELS DECISION BY END-SEPT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>British conglomerate Lonrho Plc has received a &quot;variety of bids&quot; from an unspecified number of parties from Britain and overseas for its Princess and Metropole hotels group and expects to make a decision on their future by the end of September, a spokesman told Reuters.</p>
<p>Earlier Lonrho said it had decided to defer publication of its prospectus for the flotation of its Princess and Metropole hotel groups in response to approaches by a number of parties for all or part of the group.</p>
</text>
